rustls-ffi-quic (0.15.7+quic1-1~smallgearlab1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging of rustls-ffi-quic: rustls-ffi 0.15.7 with a C API over
    rustls::quic (rustls_quic_*) for QUIC clients, from a commit of
    https://github.com/small-gear-lab/rustls-ffi-quic.
  * The exported functions are named rustlsq_*, so that the library can be
    loaded together with rustls-ffi. The library is librustls_quic, the
    pkg-config module rustls-quic, the headers are in
    /usr/include/rustls-quic.
  * The library package is named after the soname (librustls_quic.so.0.15.7).
  * Built with the aws-lc-rs provider (HPKE, so Encrypted Client Hello) and
    the cert_compression feature, as a shared library only.
  * debian/copyright: gen-crate-licenses.py writes a paragraph for each Rust
    crate that is linked in, and debian/librustls-quic*.docs installs the
    license files of those crates.

 -- small-gear-lab <289302950+marie-222@users.noreply.github.com>  Fri, 30 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0900
